{"3980390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Deadly Dungeon", "steam_appid": 3980390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly Dungeon is a dungeon crawler with turn-based combat mechanics. Explore the depths of the dungeons waiting below, but watch your step, as every move you make, could be your last. <br><br>The game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamemodes: Singleplayer or Multiplayer, both can be played on normal or hardcore.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Class System: Pick one of 4 available characters and try their unique spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps with level system: Each floor has it's own loot, enemies and events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy variations: You can find many different enemy types and bosses, each with unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory system and item rarity: In the game you can currently find many rarities such as Common, Rare and Legendary, each item providing player with stats and some even with unique effects.<br><br>The dungeons get deeper each day as new enemies arrive, will you be brave enough to delve into them?</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly Dungeon is a dungeon crawler with turn-based combat mechanics. Explore the depths of the dungeons waiting below, but watch your step, as every move you make, could be your last. <br><br>The game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamemodes: Singleplayer or Multiplayer, both can be played on normal or hardcore.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Class System: Pick one of 4 available characters and try their unique spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps with level system: Each floor has it's own loot, enemies and events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy variations: You can find many different enemy types and bosses, each with unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory system and item rarity: In the game you can currently find many rarities such as Common, Rare and Legendary, each item providing player with stats and some even with unique effects.<br><br>The dungeons get deeper each day as new enemies arrive, will you be brave enough to delve into them?</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Descend into the Deadly Dungeon in order to find freedom that was taken away from you. Deadly Dungeon is dungeon crawler with class system and turn-based combat, featuring many horror elements with retro graphics. Fight, loot, explore, but keep moving, as the next stop you make, could be your last.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980390/b32dd08e79314e1b6175aab45132d794265b10fc/header.jpg?t=1769448695", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980390/d7ec03c5fc790a7d629fc6bce49d05301b24e5b9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769448695", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980390/d7ec03c5fc790a7d629fc6bce49d05301b24e5b9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769448695", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any CPU released after 2011<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 520<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["AviXeL"], "publishers": ["AviXeL"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "